 37:38 ; 51:15 , for ( עַל ) a bit of bread Prov 28:21 ; הַזֶּה בַּרָּבָר Ezra 10:13 in this thing ; על תּוֺרָתִי Hosea 8:1 ; elsewhere with בְּ against God: ׳פ ׳ב Isa 43:27 ; 59:13 ; 66:24 ; Jer 2:8 , 29 ; 3:13 ; 33:8 ; Ezek 2:3 ; 20:38 ; Hosea 7:13 ; פ אשׁר ׳מְּשִׁעִים ב 1Kin 8:50 ; Ezek 18:31 ; פ אשׁר ׳עלילות ב Zeph 3:11 . Niph`al Perfect 3masculine singular נִפְשַׁע אָח (van d. H. Participle נִפְשָׁע ) a brother (who has been) offended Prov 18:19 , but very dubious, compare Toy.","rootNote":"a primitive root (identical with through the idea of expansion );","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 8 50","keyReferences":["1Kgs 8 50","1Kgs 12 19","2Chr 10 19","2Chr 21 8","2Chr 21 10","2Chr 21 10","2Kgs 1 1","2Kgs 3 5"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":41,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 8 50","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":50,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פָּשְׁעוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3cp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 19","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּפְשְׁע֤וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 10 19","book":"2Chr","chapter":10,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּפְשְׁע֤וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 21 8","book":"2Chr","chapter":21,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"פָּשַׁ֣ע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 21 10","book":"2Chr","chapter":21,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּפְשַׁ֨ע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 21 10","book":"2Chr","chapter":21,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תִּפְשַׁ֥ע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi3fs"},{"reference":"2Kgs 1 1","book":"2Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּפְשַׁ֤ע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"2Kgs 3 5","book":"2Kgs","chapter":3,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"